ond, but the dead pups flash in her mind, filled by rage, she sticks to her original plan.\n\nParts 5-9\n- Commence fight scene! get creative!\n\nParts 10-11\n- Arti begins to run out of energy, but continues to fight. *Movements become sluggish*\n\nPart 12:\n-Arti gets more sluggish and eventually knocked down to the ground\n\nParts 13-14:\n- Arti is forced to retreat to regain energy, scavengers do not make it easy for her.\n\nPart 15:\n-About to make it out, but stops, seeing King scav also tired as well, other scavs to distracted to help\n\nPart 16:\n- *world faded to black, only Arti and King scav visible, spotlighted -in thought-* Arti is stuck on what to do, retreat or stay, after a long second, thinking carefully, she decides to stay and fight till the end. *world fades back in at end*\n\nParts 17-19:\n- more fight scene! go nuts with these ones.\n\nPart 20: \n-Arti grabs an explosive/electric spear (ur choice), and finally manages to kill the King scav. she stands over the body at the end\n\nOutro:\n-Arti grabs onto the King scav mask, and holds it over her face, spear in other paw. all nearby scavs flee. fade to black, Arti's eyes lingering for a moment before fading."}},"currentCostume":0,"costumes":[{"name":"new Arti ref","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"26e7c95e87844f6903dfade5068149ac","md5ext":"26e7c95e87844f6903dfade5068149ac.png","rotationCenterX":477,"rotationCenterY":355},{"name":"pups","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"2efcf971f131ba4ea4622a3af4d8bb68","md5ext":"2efcf971f131ba4ea4622a3af4d8bb68.png","rotationCenterX":406,"rotationCenterY":350},{"name":"King scav","bitmapResolution":2,"dataFormat":"png","assetId":"1cbce99080238196d9af68476c6d8cee","md5ext":"1cbce99080238196d9af68476c6d8cee.png","rotationCenterX":345,"rotationCenterY":326},{"name":"Metropolis colors and ref","bitmapResolution":1,"dataFormat":"svg","assetId":"fe2483a87fd39d99307d38015b79be3f","md5ext":"fe2483a87fd39d99307d38015b79be3f.svg","rotatio